---
// Illustrative panel showing the shape of a working day for a managed agent:
// internal requests answered, work waiting on a human, and scheduled work running.
// Clearly labelled as an illustration. No fabricated metrics.
---

<div class="agent-panel">
  <div class="agent-panel-header">
    <div class="agent-panel-title">
      <span class="agent-status-dot"></span>
      <span class="agent-panel-name">OPERATIONS AGENT — A TYPICAL DAY</span>
    </div>
    <span class="label agent-panel-time">ILLUSTRATION</span>
  </div>

  <div class="agent-panel-body">
    <!-- Answering the team -->
    <div class="agent-section">
      <div class="agent-section-label label">Answering the team</div>

      <div class="conv-item">
        <div class="conv-row">
          <span class="conv-status conv-status-active">●</span>
          <span class="conv-customer">Trader, in the sales channel</span>
          <span class="conv-time">9:12 AM</span>
        </div>
        <p class="conv-preview">"What do we have on hand in 4x8, and who owns those accounts?"</p>
        <div class="conv-response">
          <span class="conv-response-label">AGENT:</span>
          Pulled from inventory and the CRM just now. Full breakdown by location and
          rep is in the thread. Two of those accounts have open opportunities closing
          this month.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="conv-item">
        <div class="conv-row">
          <span class="conv-status conv-status-active">●</span>
          <span class="conv-customer">Sales lead, in a direct message</span>
          <span class="conv-time">9:40 AM</span>
        </div>
        <p class="conv-preview">"Can we substitute on the spec that came in yesterday?"</p>
        <div class="conv-response">
          <span class="conv-response-label">AGENT:</span>
          Two substitutions meet that spec. One is a grade this customer has rejected
          before, per the account notes. I would lead with the other.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pending human approval -->
    <div class="agent-section agent-section-approval">
      <div class="agent-section-label label agent-approval-label">Waiting for your approval</div>

      <div class="approval-item">
        <div class="approval-header">
          <span class="approval-flag">⚠</span>
          <span class="approval-customer">Draft quote, 500 units</span>
          <span class="approval-type">NEEDS A HUMAN</span>
        </div>
        <p class="approval-desc">
          Drafted against your standard tier pricing and this account's history.
          Nothing sends until you say so.
        </p>
        <div class="approval-actions">
          <button class="approval-btn approval-approve" type="button" disabled>Approve</button>
          <button class="approval-btn approval-edit" type="button" disabled>Review &amp; Edit</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Running on schedule -->
    <div class="agent-section">
      <div class="agent-section-label label">Running on its own</div>

      <div class="task-item">
        <span class="task-icon">⏰</span>
        <span class="task-text">Flagging deals with no activity in two weeks</span>
        <span class="task-status">In progress</span>
      </div>
      <div class="task-item">
        <span class="task-icon">📊</span>
        <span class="task-text">Weekly pipeline report compiling</span>
        <span class="task-status">Scheduled 8am</span>
      </div>
      <div class="task-item">
        <span class="task-icon">🔄</span>
        <span class="task-text">Receivables aging reviewed, exceptions routed</span>
        <span class="task-status">Done</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="agent-note">
      An illustration of the shape of the work, not a live feed. Real deployments are
      built around your systems and your rules.
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .agent-note { padding: 1rem 1.25rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.6875rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-muted); }
  .agent-panel {
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-2);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(26,23,20,0.06);
    font-family: 'Spectral', Georgia, serif;
  }
  .agent-panel-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
  }
  .agent-panel-title { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .agent-panel-name {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }
  .agent-status-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #4ade80;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(74,222,128,0.2);
    animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.5; }
  }
  .agent-panel-time { color: var(--ink-faint); }

  .agent-panel-body { padding: 1.5rem; }

  .agent-section { margin-bottom: 1.75rem; }
  .agent-section-label { color: var(--ink-muted); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .agent-approval-label { color: var(--classification); }

  .conv-item {
    padding: 0.875rem;
    background: var(--paper-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    margin-bottom: 0.625rem;
  }
  .conv-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .conv-status { font-size: 0.5rem; color: #4ade80; }
  .conv-customer {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    flex: 1;
  }
  .conv-time {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
  .conv-preview {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0 0 0.625rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .conv-response {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding: 0.625rem 0.75rem;
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  .conv-response-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.5625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--file-tab);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-right: 0.375rem;
  }

  .agent-section-approval {
    background: rgba(140,32,32,0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--classification-faint);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1rem;
  }
  .approval-item { }
  .approval-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .approval-flag { color: var(--classification); font-size: 0.875rem; }
  .approval-customer { font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 600; flex: 1; }
  .approval-type {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--classification);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.375rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--classification);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  .approval-desc {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .approval-actions { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .approval-btn {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.5625rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 200ms;
  }
  .approval-approve { background: var(--stamp-green); color: var(--paper); border-color: var(--stamp-green); }
  .approval-approve:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
  .approval-edit { background: transparent; color: var(--ink-soft); border-color: var(--rule-2); }
  .approval-edit:hover { border-color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .task-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }
  .task-item + .task-item { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .task-icon { font-size: 0.875rem; }
  .task-text { flex: 1; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .task-status {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.5625rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .agent-stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .agent-stat { flex: 1; text-align: center; }
  .agent-stat-num {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Spectral', serif;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .agent-stat-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    margin-top: 0.375rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
</style>
